# A target of negative literals (#147) that a computed value can leave:
# {a: 2} gives 1, which -1 | 0 rejects.
-- source.cue --
a: 0 | 1 | 2
-- target.cue --
m: -1 | 0
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {m: v0_0.a - 1}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.m is v0_0.a - 1, which may be as high as 1, where the target schema requires <=0 (rule computed-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:11
